    <books>{
      # Relay Mesh

      The Relay Mesh was the communications backbone of the Helios fleet.

      ## Topology

      The network used a distributed mesh design.

      ```netiv
      °define •nodePrime: •string = "fleet coordination";
      °define •nodeEdge: •string = "local vessel routing";
      °define •nodeBurst: •string = "emergency transmission";
      °define •nodeArchive: •string = "long-term telemetry storage";
      ```

      ## Known Problems

      - packet reorder instability
      - excessive recursive retries
      - delayed monotonic timestamp propagation
      - consensus deadlocks

      ## Connection To DriftCore

      The Relay Mesh supplied DriftCore with timing and routing consensus data.
    };
